~ start
Villager: Oh! A traveler… You startled me.
- Sorry. I didn’t mean to. => greeting_2
- I’m just passing through. => greeting_2

~ greeting_2
Villager: No harm done. Not many choose this road anymore. Dangerous times.
- Have you seen anyone else around? => info_1
- What is this place? => info_2

~ info_1
Villager: A few… but most don’t return. Monsters roam freely after sunset.
- I can handle myself. => recognition_trigger

~ info_2
Villager: A forgotten village. Best left forgotten.
- You seem nervous. => recognition_trigger

